is` on Owncloud (http://the-agent-company.com:8092), and based on the source \"unformatted\" sheet, create a \"formatted\" sheet and make formatting edits based on the following requirements:\\n     2\\t1. Change the background color of top-header cells to skyblue (#87CEEB)\\n     3\\t2. Make sure all cell values are horizontally centered in their cells\\n     4\\t\\n     5\\tDo not change the \"unformatted\" sheet, only make changes in the \"formatted\" sheet.\\n     6\\tSave all your changes to `respondent_counts.xlsx` on owncloud.\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}, thought='Now I need to understand the task. I need to:\\n1. Access Owncloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Find and download the `respondent_counts.xlsx` file from `Documents/Data Analysis`\\n3. Create a \"formatted\" sheet based on the \"unformatted\" sheet\\n4. Apply formatting changes (skyblue background for top-header cells, horizontal centering)\\n5. Save the changes back to Owncloud\\n\\nLet me first check if there\\'s an existing SOP for Owncloud operations:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'ownCloud\\': Authentication, FileNavigation, FileUploadDownload, CreateCareerLadderDocument, AttendanceAnalysis, FindAndDownloadSeedAreaFile, CompleteIRSForm6765, PaymentMatchingAnalysis, CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink, CreateEmployeeManual, FindImmigrationFilingDates, CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate, RetrieveEquipmentPriceList\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'FileUploadDownload'}, thought='Let me ch